From d349ea7d9902f1915f3134db58b9a6e24aaa838f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 08:56:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 97/98] docs: images/classify names the tflite, executorch and
 onnxruntime recipes

The route spec, and the API reference regenerated from it, said the model
must use the tflite recipe. It now names all three engines, the graph file
each one loads, the NCHW layout PyTorch exports declare, and the *_args
option of each. The label reference and the custom-model guide say the
same.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
