 ## `POST /v1/images/classify`
 <sub>![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/status-experimental-orange)</sub>
 
-Classifies one image and returns the top-scoring labels. The model must be labeled `image-classification` and use the `tflite` recipe, which runs it in a `tflite-server` (0.2.0 or newer) subprocess on the CPU. The request is either `multipart/form-data` (the same shape as `/v1/images/edits`) or `application/json`, and only JPEG and PNG are accepted, with EXIF orientation not applied.
+Classifies one image and returns the top-scoring labels. The model must be labeled `image-classification` and use the `tflite`, `executorch` or `onnxruntime` recipe, which runs it on the CPU in a `tflite-server` (0.2.0 or newer), `et-server` or `ort-server` subprocess; all three return the same response. The request is either `multipart/form-data` (the same shape as `/v1/images/edits`) or `application/json`, and only JPEG and PNG are accepted, with EXIF orientation not applied.
 
 Requires `LEMONADE_API_KEY` when it is set.
 
